                    <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-semibold text-dark text-base gap-4"
                        onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        What is GEO, and why should I care?
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined faq-icon text-primary shrink-0 text-[20px]">add</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer px-5 pb-5 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) means optimising for AI search – ChatGPT, Gemini,
                        Perplexity, Google AI Overviews. These don't return ten blue links, they compose an answer, and
                        they quote factual, well-structured content to do it. If your webshop has no such text, those
                        answers get written without you – even if you have the best price.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item bg-light rounded-[12px] border border-border overflow-hidden">
                    <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-semibold text-dark text-base gap-4"
                        onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        Can it write thousands of product descriptions?
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined faq-icon text-primary shrink-0 text-[20px]">add</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer px-5 pb-5 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Yes, it runs in bulk – you don't prompt it product by product. You pick which products or
                        categories to cover, the system generates the copy in sequence, and after your approval uploads
                        it back into your store.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item bg-light rounded-[12px] border border-border overflow-hidden">
                    <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-semibold text-dark text-base gap-4"
                        onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        Which webshop platforms does it work with?
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined faq-icon text-primary shrink-0 text-[20px]">add</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer px-5 pb-5 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Currently <strong>Unas</strong> and <strong>Shoprenter</strong> – these have the direct,
                        two-way connection (reading and writing back). If you're on another platform, we'll look at the
                        options on the demo.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item bg-light rounded-[12px] border border-border overflow-hidden">
                    <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-semibold text-dark text-base gap-4"
                        onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        When will I see results?
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined faq-icon text-primary shrink-0 text-[20px]">add</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer px-5 pb-5 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Honestly: search optimisation is measured in months, not days – nobody can get around that. With
                        product descriptions there's an immediate effect too, though: people already on your site read
                        better copy and are more likely to buy. That's why it's worth doing both together.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item bg-light rounded-[12px] border border-border overflow-hidden">
                    <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-semibold text-dark text-base gap-4"
                        onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        Do I need SEO knowledge?
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined faq-icon text-primary shrink-0 text-[20px]">add</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer px-5 pb-5 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        No. Keyword research, copy structure, meta data and internal linking are part of the process. You
                        set your brand voice and audience once, then approve what gets created.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item bg-light rounded-[12px] border border-border overflow-hidden">
                    <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-semibold text-dark text-base gap-4"
                        onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        Do the three modules cost extra?
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined faq-icon text-primary shrink-0 text-[20px]">add</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer px-5 pb-5 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        No. The same 34,990 HUF + VAT / month subscription covers all of them, with 500 renewing AI
                        credits – posting and newsletters included. Generation consumes credits;
                        <a href="/en/pricing/#kreditek" class="text-primary font-semibold underline">see the detailed
                        credit costs here</a>.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
